                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#d7ab14' fontsize='12'>Each KPI is defined based on the last </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#e15759' fontsize='14'>30 or 90 days experience period</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#d7ab14' fontsize='12'> of the respondednt. </run>
