                <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#d7ab14' fontsize='12'> This deepdive is only related to the respondents of the </run>
                <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#e15759' fontsize='14'>R NPS </run>
                <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#d7ab14' fontsize='12'>survey. </run>
                <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#d7ab14' fontsize='12'>Each KPI is defined based on the last </run>
                <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#e15759' fontsize='14'>30 or 90 days experience period</run>
                <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#d7ab14' fontsize='12'> of the respondednt. </run>
