                <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#e15759' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>:</run>
                <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#d3b348' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='12'>Now you can select</run>
                <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#d3b348' fontname='Tableau Medium'>Æ </run>
                <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#e15759' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='14'>Country, Survey Vertical Type or Segment </run>
                <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#d3b348' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='12'>etc from the</run>
                <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#d3b348' fontname='Tableau Medium'>Æ </run>
